# Frontend Conventions

## Layout

- Pages: `src/pages/` — thin, compose features
- Logic: `src/features/<domain>/`
- shadcn: `src/components/ui/`

## Data

- Prefer `@workspace/api-client-react` when endpoint is in OpenAPI
- L2 uses `features/l2-circuits/l2-circuits-api.ts`

## UX

- Follow `docs/frontend/UX_GUARDRAILS.md`
- Dark theme default; match existing badge/table patterns
- Wouter routes in `App.tsx`

## After changes

```bash
cd workspace/artifacts/netops-manager && npx tsc --noEmit
docker compose build web && docker compose up -d web
```
